    n8n -->|07:00 JST| pj
    pj --> rep
    rep -->|read-only| mcp
    pj -->|push up/down| kuma
  end
  subgraph play[OSS playground]
    direction TB
    graf[Grafana :3000]:::ok
    prom[Prometheus :9090]:::ok
    node[node-exporter]:::ok
    graf --> prom --> node
  end
  ufw ==> n8n
  ufw ==> graf
  pj -->|HTTPS GET| gh[GitHub REST API]:::ext
